##* {{RQ:Erasmus Roper Pater Noster|sig=d.iij.|verso=1|page=31|passage=Than thou madeſt heuẽ {{quote-gloss|heaven}} free and '''rydde''' from all rebellion&#11850; {{...}}}}
##* {{RQ:Palsgrave Lesclarcissement|book=3rd|chapter=The Table of Verbes|folio=cccxli|verso=1|column=2|passage=If I coulde conuenyently '''rydde''' me of this felowe I wolde go with you w&#877; {{quote-gloss|with}} all my herte: {{...}}}}
