###* {{RQ:Shakespeare Romeo and Juliet Q1-2|act=III|scene=i|sig=F2|verso=1|page=45|passage=The furious ''{{w|Tybalt}}'' caſt an enuious thruſt {{quote-gloss|of the rapier}}, / That '''rid''' the life of ſtout ''{{w|Mercutio}}''.}}
