###* {{RQ:Palsgrave Lesclarcissement|book=3rd|chapter=The Table of Verbes|folio=cccxli|verso=1|column=1|passage=I '''Rydde''' buſyneſſe that I haue in hande I do it quyckly&#11805; {{...}} He is a quicke workeman he can '''rydde''' more worke in an houre than ſome can do in twayne: {{...}}}}
